  "description": {
    "raw": "A wavering red ray projects from your finger. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack with the ray to hit your target.\n\nThe ray inflicts 1d4 points of nonlethal damage, causing the target to suffer from heatstroke as its body temperature dramatically increases. Except as noted above, this spell otherwise functions as ray of exhaustion.\n\nCharacters wearing heavy clothing or armor of any sort take a –4 penalty on their saves.",
    "search_text": "\"a wavering red ray projects from your finger. you must succeed on a ranged touch attack with the ray to hit your target.\\n\\nthe ray inflicts 1d4 points of nonlethal damage, causing the target to suffer from heatstroke as its body temperature dramatically increases. except as noted above, this spell otherwise functions as ray of exhaustion.\\n\\ncharacters wearing heavy clothing or armor of any sort take a –4 penalty on their saves.\"",
